Third-party notices
===================

syntaxes/powershell.tmLanguage.json

The PowerShell TextMate grammar comes from microsoft/vscode (extensions/powershell), which converts it from
PowerShell/EditorSyntax (PowerShellSyntax.tmLanguage, commit 23eed76d483c887a1608609e9dd57e09666411cc).
